{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260523105856aae6cf5b6d7e4823","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**任务 #4: 平衡性调整**\n\n主要问题：\n1. 修炼速率不会随等级提升\n2. 化神期经验曲线过于陡峭\n3. 飞升所需修炼值（10M）过低\n4. 符箓阈值过低\n5. 傀儡速度过慢（3秒）"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"094f9230-fe12-4466-ab83-fdd0d233a191","uuid":"9f2afdce-953b-40ed-aa57-e3f2b51352eb"}
